         application. Remove this <p> once Awin confirm ownership; see
         content-queue.md for the tracking note. Must stay visible (no CSS
         hiding) — Awin checks the live rendered page, not a screenshot. -->
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);">HELLO AWIN</p>
  </div>
</Base>
